OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged with murder of man
OL,4,Aappear in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men charged with the murder of a
OL,7,Fman have appeared in court.
OL,9,FDarrell Rowland, 49, from St Austell,
OL,10,Fand Sukhvinder Singh Shokur, 58, from
OL,11,FLiskeard, appeared at Truro Crown Court
OL,12,Fvia video link from Exeter Prison on
OL,13,FTuesday.
OL,15,FThe men are accused of the murder of
OL,16,FIan Davis, 56, who was found with
OL,17,Fmultiple injuries at a property on
OL,18,FBaytree Hill, Liskeard, on 13 September
OL,19,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
