OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged with murder of man
OL,4,Aappear in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard Rowland plead not
OL,7,Fguilty to the murder charge and Shokur
OL,8,Fdid not enter a plea. Both men have
OL,9,Fbeen remanded in custody.
